{"speciesId":449,"names":{"fr":"Hippopotas","es":"Hippopotas","en":"Hippopotas","ja":"ヒポポタス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It lives in arid places. Instead of perspiration, it expels grainy sand from its body."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It enshrouds itself with sand to protect itself from germs. It does not enjoy getting wet."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It shuts its nostrils tight then travels through sand as if walking. They form colonies of around ten."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It shrouds itself in sand to ward off germs. It travels easily through the sands of the desert."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It shrouds itself in sand to ward off germs. It travels easily through the sands of the desert."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il peut obturer ses narines et traverser le sable comme un ver. Il vit en colonies de 10 individus."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It shuts its nostrils tight then travels through sand as if walking. They form colonies of around ten."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il peut obturer ses narines et traverser le sable comme un ver. Il vit en colonies de 10 individus."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It shuts its nostrils tight then travels through sand as if walking. They form colonies of around ten."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It shuts its nostrils tight then travels through sand as if walking. They form colonies of around 10."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It shuts its nostrils tight then travels through sand as if walking. They form colonies of around 10."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il vit dans des endroits arides. Il exsude du sable granuleux au lieu de transpirer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vive en zonas áridas. En lugar de sudar, su cuerpo expulsa granos de arena."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It lives in 